What is Llama?

Llama (Large Language Model Meta AI) is a family of Large Language Models (LLMs) developed by Meta (the company behind Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp).

Like ChatGPT is developed by OpenAI, Llama is developed by Meta.

=======

Simple Explanation

Think of an LLM as a very intelligent AI assistant that understands and generates human language.

Examples:

| Company    | AI Model                             |
| ---------- | ------------------------------------ |
| OpenAI     | GPT-5.5, GPT-4                       |
| Meta       | Llama 2, Llama 3, Llama 3.1, Llama 4 |
| Google     | Gemini                               |
| Anthropic  | Claude                               |
| Mistral AI | Mistral                              |


=====


What can Llama do?

Llama can:

💬 Answer questions
📝 Write articles
💻 Generate code
🌐 Translate languages
📚 Summarize documents
🤖 Power AI chatbots
🧠 Assist AI agents

Example

User:

Write Python code to add two numbers.

Llama:

a = 10
b = 20

print(a + b)

